   - `p25092_ATP.top` – the full GROMACS topology including protein and ligand.  
   - `p25092_ATP.gro` – the coordinate file for the solvated system.  
   - `p25092_ATP.mdp` – the parameter file specifying the simulation conditions.  
   - `p25092_ATP.tpr` – the binary run file ready for `gmx mdrun`.  
   - `p25092_ATP_ligand.itp` – the ligand topology generated by GAFF/GAFF2.  
   
   These files constitute a ready‑to‑run simulation system that can be submitted to an HPC queue for equilibration and production runs, while the workflow itself stops short of any simulation execution.
